<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&family=Quicksand:wght@300..700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .content strong {
            color: #1a5f3f;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background:#4CAF50;
            /* background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4CAF50 0%, #1a5f3f 100%); */
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(26, 95, 63, 0.3);
        }

        .warning {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .link-text {
            word-break: break-all;
            color: #1a5f3f;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .divider {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{ user.firstName ?? 'there' }}</strong>,</p>

            <p>We received a request to reset the password for your Growfico account. If you didn't make this request,
                you can safely ignore this email.</p>

            <p style="margin-top: 25px;">To reset your password, click the button below:</p>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{ reset_url }}" class="cta-button">Reset Password</a>
            </div>

            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">Or copy this link:</p>
            <p class="link-text" style="text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;">{{ reset_url }}</p>

            <div class="warning">
                <strong>Important:</strong> This password reset link will expire in <strong>{{ expiry_hours }} hour{{ expiry_hours > 1 ? 's' : '' }}</strong>.
                If the link has expired, you can request a new one.
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #777;">
                <strong>Security Tip:</strong> Never share this link with anyone. Growfico will never ask you to share
                your password or click links in unexpected emails requesting sensitive information.
            </p>

            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #777; margin-top: 15px;">
                If you didn't request a password reset, please <a href="#"
                    style="color: #1a5f3f; text-decoration: none;"><strong>contact our support team</strong></a>
                immediately to secure your account.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>The Growfico Team</strong></p>
            <p>Cultivating Green Futures </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 15px; color: #999; font-size: 11px;">
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
